# Version Control
**/.git

# Development Configuration
**/.env*
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile*

# Documentation and Tests
**/docs
**/tests
**/*.md
!streamget/README.md

# Build Artifacts and Cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.log
**/node_modules
**/venv

# IDE Files
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Static Assets (Adjust as needed)
**/.iconset/
**/*.icns
# Exclude large desktop-only images from the Docker context, but keep the web sidebar logo
assets/images/*
!assets/images/logo-mark.svg
# Local fallback font cache (assets/fonts/noto* etc.) is baked into the image at build time:
# Dockerfile copies assets/fonts/ into flet_web/web/assets/fonts/ so no_cdn web mode serves the
# Chinese/etc. fallback subsets offline. Keep them in the context so that COPY can include them.
# (AlibabaPuHuiTi is also baked in via that same COPY.)